name: Enterprise
tagline: "Internal audit and insider threat on synthetic data - a fictitious vendor, a shell cluster, split invoices, a single point of control and an intercompany round trip; a leaver's bulk reads and mail to a personal domain, access creep granted by one manager, and two employees approving each other's expenses, every Dataset mapped."
